    <string-array name="preset_descriptions"><item>Home from the bottom edge only. Minimal intervention.</item><item>Back, Home, and Recents across three bottom areas.</item><item>Back from both sides and Home from the bottom for balanced daily use.</item><item>Back and Home on upper/lower right; Notifications and Recents on hold.</item><item>Back and Home on upper/lower left; Notifications and Recents on hold.</item><item>Back/previous app on both edges, with Home/Assistant at the bottom.</item><item>Back, Home, and Recents across the bottom; panels and Assistant on hold.</item><item>Track, playback, and volume controls across three bottom areas.</item><item>Force-stop the foreground app with hold gestures. Requires root.</item><item>Back, Home, and mute on hold for a low-distraction night setup.</item><item>Back, brightness down on hold, and Home.</item><item>Back, Quick Settings, and Recents within one-hand reach.</item><item>Back, voice assistant, and notification panel.</item><item>Screenshot, Home, and Recents for content creation.</item><item>Only Back and Home for a clean, simple experience.</item><item>Back and previous app, with Recents on hold.</item><item>Home, Quick Settings, and bottom Back/Recents.</item><item>Back, brightness up on hold, and Assistant.</item><item>Back, mute, and screen lock on hold.</item><item>Left/right track switching; bottom playback and volume on hold.</item></string-array>
